<title>HONG KONG: Nam Hing interim net falls.</title>
<headline>Nam Hing interim net falls.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   0.8    vs 8.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0    vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    2.41   vs 22.49</p>
<p>    Turnover		     152.59 vs 170.63</p>
<p>    Company name		 Nam Hing Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  na</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   Jan 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Nam Hing Holdings makes laminates for electrical and electronic products. It also makes printed circuit boards and trades in raw materials and chemicals.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
